WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.701 --> 00:00:03.968
-Welcome back, everyone. We are hanging out with Halle Berry!

00:00:03.968 --> 00:00:06.501
-[ Cheers and applause ] -Halle Berry.

00:00:06.501 --> 00:00:08.300
Now, you are an amazing

00:00:08.300 --> 00:00:11.734
award-winning actor and director now,

00:00:11.734 --> 00:00:13.567
but it also means that you're in touch

00:00:13.567 --> 00:00:15.334
with many different emotions,

00:00:15.334 --> 00:00:17.334
so I want to see just how emotional we can get.

00:00:17.334 --> 00:00:19.801
[Voice breaking] It's time for an Emotional Interview.

00:00:19.801 --> 00:00:24.267
-♪ The Emotional Interview ♪

00:00:24.267 --> 00:00:25.901
-Halle, here's how it works.

00:00:25.901 --> 00:00:27.901
We're going to have a normal conversation with each other,

00:00:27.901 --> 00:00:30.734
except every so often we're going to hear this ding sound.

00:00:30.734 --> 00:00:32.300
-[ Ding ] -And when we hear that, we'll be

00:00:32.300 --> 00:00:34.000
given an emotion on your screen,

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:36.968
and then we just have to keep acting it out as we're talking.

00:00:36.968 --> 00:00:38.434
Sound good?

00:00:38.434 --> 00:00:40.934
-Yes, and we stay in the same conversation?

00:00:40.934 --> 00:00:42.701
-Yeah, stay in the same conversation.

00:00:42.701 --> 00:00:44.100
We can talk about whatever.

00:00:44.100 --> 00:00:46.133
We can start it off talking about whatever we like.

00:00:46.133 --> 00:00:48.434
How about succulent plants?

00:00:48.434 --> 00:00:50.834
Let's do that. Is that okay?

00:00:50.834 --> 00:00:52.100
-Succulent plants?

00:00:52.100 --> 00:00:54.334
-Yeah, succulents, like cactuses and all that --

00:00:54.334 --> 00:00:56.434
-Okay. Succulent. Succulent. Succulent.

00:00:56.434 --> 00:00:58.234
-[ Ding ] -Why did you have me back here?

00:00:58.234 --> 00:01:00.968
Why have you asked me to be here to talk about succulents?

00:01:00.968 --> 00:01:02.601
-Well, you have one in -- -So what?

00:01:02.601 --> 00:01:05.067
-Well, it looks like a real one in the background of your Zoom.

00:01:05.067 --> 00:01:06.901
I'm just saying. I don't know. -But why --

00:01:06.901 --> 00:01:08.167
Jimmy, why am I here? Why am I here?

00:01:08.167 --> 00:01:09.734
-Well, are you there? -What do you need from me?

00:01:09.734 --> 00:01:11.667
-But are you there? -Usually people --

00:01:11.667 --> 00:01:12.934
I'm not there, but I'm here.

00:01:12.934 --> 00:01:14.334
And usually people want me somewhere

00:01:14.334 --> 00:01:15.734
because they want something. -Yeah.

00:01:15.734 --> 00:01:17.834
-What do you want from me? What do you want from me?

00:01:17.834 --> 00:01:20.434
Money? Money? A-Are you broke?

00:01:20.434 --> 00:01:21.567
[ Ding ]

00:01:21.567 --> 00:01:23.567
-Well, I -- You want money from me?

00:01:23.567 --> 00:01:24.801
Are you kidding me? You're Halle Berry.

00:01:24.801 --> 00:01:27.601
-Oh, my God! You want money from me!

00:01:27.601 --> 00:01:29.400
[ Gasps ] -No, no, no.

00:01:29.400 --> 00:01:32.534
-I thought you were rich! -Oh, oh, oh, oh, oh!

00:01:32.534 --> 00:01:35.234
Money! Oh, money, from me. -You're broke.

00:01:35.234 --> 00:01:36.634
-Yeah, of course, yeah. That's why --

00:01:36.634 --> 00:01:38.434
-You're broke! Holy [bleep]

00:01:38.434 --> 00:01:39.434
[ Ding ]

00:01:39.434 --> 00:01:42.868
-I -- I -- I -- I don't have --

00:01:42.868 --> 00:01:45.667
I did lose a lot of money in crypto.

00:01:45.667 --> 00:01:47.234
And so, what happened was -- -

00:01:47.234 --> 00:01:49.634
-Where's Quest? I want to talk to Quest.

00:01:49.634 --> 00:01:50.968
Questlove? Where's Quest?

00:01:50.968 --> 00:01:52.334
I want to speak to Quest. -I just want to talk about --

00:01:52.334 --> 00:01:53.868
-Where's Quest? -What happened was I ended up

00:01:53.868 --> 00:01:55.200
investing -- -I really want to talk --

00:01:55.200 --> 00:01:57.801
Jimmy, whatever. I want -- Hey, Quest.

00:01:57.801 --> 00:01:59.434
Hey, love. Hey. -Yeah.

00:01:59.434 --> 00:02:01.567
[ Ding ]

00:02:01.567 --> 00:02:05.734
[ Laughter ]

00:02:05.734 --> 00:02:08.501
-What?

00:02:08.501 --> 00:02:12.868
Are you -- What are -- What are you doing?

00:02:12.868 --> 00:02:17.567
You're sitting there looking very weird, Jimmy.

00:02:17.567 --> 00:02:19.667
-I'm having fun. -What are you doing?

00:02:19.667 --> 00:02:21.167
-Are you having fun? -You don't look like you're --

00:02:21.167 --> 00:02:22.334
-I'm having fun.

00:02:22.334 --> 00:02:23.534
-I'm having a terrible time here.

00:02:23.534 --> 00:02:24.834
-Are you having fun? -I'm not sure why I came.

00:02:24.834 --> 00:02:28.868
-For representative, say, "Representative."

00:02:28.868 --> 00:02:30.734
-What? -For human, say --

00:02:30.734 --> 00:02:32.434
[ Ding ]

00:02:34.767 --> 00:02:35.901
[ Laughter ]

00:02:35.901 --> 00:02:37.968
-Oh, my God. -That's a long one.

00:02:37.968 --> 00:02:40.234
Yeah, that was -- -Jimmy, do you remember

00:02:40.234 --> 00:02:41.734
the last time you came to my house?

00:02:41.734 --> 00:02:43.133
-Yeah.

00:02:43.133 --> 00:02:45.467
-You remember the last time you came to my house for dinner?

00:02:45.467 --> 00:02:46.901
-You know what -- -Do you remember?

00:02:46.901 --> 00:02:48.367
You remember the last time?

00:02:48.367 --> 00:02:51.534
-Yeah, I came. I was wearing a red hat and -- Yes.

00:02:51.534 --> 00:02:54.100
-You know what? That reminds me --

00:02:54.100 --> 00:02:57.000
when my high-school football team went to the States!

00:02:57.000 --> 00:02:58.934
[ Bell dinging ]

00:02:58.934 --> 00:03:01.701
-There you have it. That was an emotional interview.

00:03:01.701 --> 00:03:04.234
Halle Berry. [ Laughs ]

00:03:04.234 --> 00:03:07.467
"Moonfall" is in theaters next Friday.

